menu "Test harness"

config HARNESS
    bool "Scripted UI test harness" if !DEVKIT_SIMULATOR
    default y if DEVKIT_SIMULATOR
    default n
    select BSP_HARNESS
    help
        Compile the harness.h line protocol and its transport (IDF log console
        on device, stdin/stdout on the host) so tools/harness/harness.py can
        drive the UI and read the screen back. Pulls in the bsp_harness.h
        injection hooks and the libs/image_framework JPEG encoder; leave off in
        production builds. The simulator always has it -- its wifi backend and
        present loop use the harness directly.

endmenu
